{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:5Adyen23TwintSDKActionComponentC13ConfigurationV15maxIssuerNumberSivp","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"maxIssuerNumber","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIssuerNumber","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"modules":[{"name":"Adyen"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/TwintSDKActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct\/maxIssuerNumber"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The issuer number of the highest scheme you listed under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LSApplicationQueriesSchemes"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"E.g. pass 39, if you listed all schemes from “twint-issuer1” up to and including “twint-issuer39”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The value is clamped between 0 and 39."}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adyen\/twintsdkactioncomponent\/configuration-swift.struct\/maxissuernumber"]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/TwintSDKActionComponent","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/TwintSDKActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":